<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nuco2 cut to accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nuco2 cut to accumulate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it downgraded NuCo2 Inc (Fowler Carbonics Inc) to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 5-7/8 to 13-1/8.</p>
